# P1 (QUALIFICATION): packed prefix reuse, ISOLATION, exactness AND lifecycle in one job, on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit (the audit twin of the shipping profile: prefix reuse with sticky
# sessions, GDN checkpoints at 2048). Two arms of c2_prefix_gate. exactness-shared IS the isolation arm: on an eight-seat profile it runs EIGHT same-tenant agents
# sharing the system block, continuing in packed rounds, hits from ~5k up, every hit byte-identical to its solo cold twin, per-window KV digests equal, every agent
# pair IDENTICAL, AT LEAST ONE PACKED ROUND WITH 2+ LIVE USERS (under the audits this re-proves, for W1's device writers, that no lever corrupts a shared prefix-cached
# block; the census test must also name them, ORDER NEEDS N3). lifecycle-evict: four arrivals at once, abort while waiting, ABORT DURING A HIT PREFILL, a KV flood that
# EVICTS conversations, reset_prefix_cache, the KILL SWITCH file (grants off, latched, nothing published under it) and an in-place restart. Returning turns must be
# byte-equal to cold in both arms. READ: the gate verdicts: no FAIL; a returning turn is byte-equal to cold (strict: the fast path is batch invariant, NOT_COMPARABLE
# is no excuse); no program compiled by a hit after its cold twin; the kill switch row; 'aborted as intended' lines for the two drills only. Baseline none.
# exactness-eager, -traced, -audit, lifecycle-store, lifecycle-tiny and timing are dropped from this lean pack. Real time: ESTIMATE ~110 (no measured time for these arms on
# the W1 window; their docker timeouts are 7200 and 9000 s): the dominant job of the pack.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the ship/262k-prefix pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over that file on a throwaway
# commit of the integration branch (with its evidence files committed) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has
# the order, stop rules, real minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 is the ONE shipping image X0B builds: every job serves it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exactness-shared,lifecycle-evict
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
